diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index eb468f3..4684d97 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -10,6 +10,10 @@
 
 A lightweight vLLM implementation built from scratch.
 
+## PegaFlow 单卡推理实验
+
+本分支基于 nano-vLLM 实现了有界 CPU 前缀 KV 缓存，实测比较了 GPU 淘汰后的恢复和重算。验收报告记录了同一负载的首 token 延迟、无复用代价和复跑命令。[一页项目展示（PDF）](docs/PROJECT_BRIEF.pdf) · [阶段 2 验收报告](docs/STAGE2_ACCEPTANCE.md)
+
 ## Key Features
 
 * 🚀 **Fast offline inference** - Comparable inference speeds to vLLM
